(text "TPS2553 current limit 24k: about 1.0-1.2 A; FAULT_N is shared with the other channels (one red LED on the power sheet). Pull the LINK jumper before plugging node USB. 2.2k series resistors keep a powered P4 from back-feeding an unpowered node through its pins." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b172516b-aa70-56b5-890d-76892625dba3"))
